comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-04T18:26:03.448Z","harness:claude-code","Duplicate check: searched restore from history, zero-byte item, corrupted stream tail, missing item file recovery. The closed v2026.5.1 restore-recovery lineage (linked recurs_from) covered absent files only. Reproduced live on the 2026.9.4 build in a sandbox tracker before filing: three verified history entries, zero-byte item file, get and restore both refuse with the TOON shape error."
  "2026-09-04T19:42:55.221Z","harness:codex","Implementation scope combines verified restoration, invalid-tail salvage, stable addresses, identity reservation, and replay-gate evidence with pm-m0yjtg, pm-qw1uw6, pm-e3gn0z, and pm-wlqxg3. GitHub issue 1171 already links this canonical owner. No duplicate item created."
  "2026-09-04T20:00:51.081Z","harness:codex","Safety contract: salvage is a separate explicit single-stream repair mode, refuses parseable interior records and potentially complete records with attached corruption, preserves verified prefix bytes and hash epoch, binds ownership to a readable current item or verified replay, rechecks snapshots under lock and appends a suffix-digest receipt. It does not normalize provenance or reconcile current state."
  "2026-09-04T21:05:43.648Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: Recover unreadable UTF-8 item documents from verified history and salvage only an invalid trailing suffix with byte-preserving audit receipts and concurrency guards. The recovery and negative-control integration fixtures passed; temporary-tracker acceptance confirmed byte-identical restoration, unchanged dry-run bytes, retained-prefix bytes and suffix digest. Windows execution remains a required hosted check before merge. Repository-wide exact 100/100/100/100 coverage and pnpm quality:static passed without weakening thresholds. All changed surfaces are linked to canonical delivery items. Hosted PR review and merged-main operational verification are pending and must pass before merge; the already published 2026.9.4 artifact does not contain this branch."
